igh card (♥2), I should support by taking control with RedJoker rather than passing back to the landlord. The bomb is overkill here. RedJoker is the right balance - it wins control without wasting the bomb.\n\nReason: My teammate played ♥2 to try to gain control, showing they likely have a strong sequence or combination ready. I should support this by playing RedJoker to secure control and pass it to them, rather than letting the landlord regain control by passing. The bomb would be wasteful against a single card - bombs should be reserved for critical situations or the endgame.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["RedJoker"]}'}
